            <ArticleTitle>Models of visceral pain: colorectal distension (CRD).</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>Unit 5.36</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <ELocationID EIdType="doi" ValidYN="Y">10.1002/0471141755.ph0536s25</ELocationID>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>The visceromotor response to balloon distension of the colon is a robust behavioral model of visceral nociception in rodents and is ideally suited for studying the visceral antinociceptive activity of drugs. This unit describes, in detail, quantification of this response with the use of electromyography in both rats and mice.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
